1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:04,420
好了好了 她来了
Okay, okay.Here she comes!

2
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:07,160
母亲节快乐 哇噢
Happy mother's day...oh!

3
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,640
你穿着这是什么东西
What are you wearing?

4
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:10,080
你不记得这件T恤了
You don't remember this shirt?

5
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,200
你还在上幼儿园时 你送我的母亲节礼物
You made it for me for mother's day in kindergarten.

6
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,140
-太可爱了 -太邪恶了
- It's adorable. - It's perverted.

7
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:15,547
感觉就像你被
It looks like you were felt up

8
00:00:15,597 --> 00:00:17,848
-街角那个变态给骚扰了 -为什么是那个人
- By that creepy guy around the coner. - Ew! Why him?

9
00:00:17,879 --> 00:00:20,120
只有他有双畸形的小手
'cause he's got, like, freakishly tiny hands.

10
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:20,920
别瞎说
Thank you!

11
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,780
真不敢相信你居然还留着这件T恤
I cannot believe you kept that shirt.

12
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,700
我当然会留着 我是你的母亲
Of course I kept it. I'm your mother.

13
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,860
你做的任何东西我都留着
I keep everything you make me.

14
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:27,960
求你脱下吧
Please take that off.

15
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,180
除非我死了
Oh, when I'm dead.

16
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:31,280
今天是我的节日
Today is my special day,

17
00:00:31,302 --> 00:00:33,627
现在我品尝一下咖啡
And I am gonna enjoy me some coffee.

18
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:36,900
-你应该知道那是个笔筒吧 -现在知道了
- You know that's a pencil holder, right? - Oh, I do now.

19
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:39,020
你先来
Go first.

20
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,720
-不 你先来 -曼尼 别磨蹭了
- No, you can go first. - Manny, go first!

21
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,500
不要 杰 你先来
No, Jay, you go first.

22
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,100
别闹了 速度上缴礼物
Ah, somebody give me a present!

23
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:48,260
天啊 杰 钻石项链
Oh, Jay, a diamond necklace!

24
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,120
谢谢你
Thank you!

25
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:51,420
你应得的
You deserve it.

26
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:52,560
送吧 孩子
Go ahead, kid.

27
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:54,680
母亲节快乐 妈妈
Happy mother's day, mom.

28
00:00:57,420 --> 00:01:00,120
果味麦圈项链
A necklace made of the froot loops!

29
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,580
我爱死它了
I love it!

30
00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:04,440
我知道比不上钻石的 妈妈
I know they're not exactly diamonds, mom.

31
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:06,800
哪有 它们漂亮极了
No, they're beautiful.

32
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:08,520
等等 我要忏悔一下
You know what? I got a confession to make.

33
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,660
那些不是真的钻石 假的
Those aren't real diamonds. No.

34
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:12,920
还给我 回头我给你买真的
Here, give them back. I'll get you some real ones later.

35
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,660
该死 我也要澄清一下
Dang it. Now I got to come clean.

36
00:01:15,691 --> 00:01:18,791
那些不是真的果味麦圈 是无厂家的伪劣产品
These aren't real froot loops. They're generic.

37
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:23,560
到手的鸭子都飞了
Now I have no presents again.

38
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,360
早上好
Good morning!

39
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:32,920
这是什么
Hey, what's this?

40
00:01:33,140 --> 00:01:35,040
我知道你为了照顾莉莉 有时不得不晚睡
Well, I know you've had some late nights with Lily,

41
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:37,640
这是我向你表达爱意和谢意的方式
And this is just my way of saying "Thank you" And "I love you."

42
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,180
谢谢你
Oh, thank you.

43
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:40,760
好戏才刚刚开始
And this is just the beginning.

44
00:01:40,808 --> 00:01:43,332
没错 因为今天是你的节日
Yeah, 'cause today is your day.

45
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:43,860
今天
Today?

46
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:45,000
一整天哦
All day.

47
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,740
今天 今天是我的节日
Today. Today is my day.

48
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:49,580
感觉开始不对路了
Something's happening.

49
00:01:49,610 --> 00:01:52,030
-今天是母亲节 -那又如何
- It mother's day, Mitchell. - So?

50
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,460
你在母亲节给我端上了这份丰盛的早餐
You're bringing me breakfast in bed on mother's day.

51
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,620
别这么想 这不是母亲节特供早餐
Okay, no, no, this is not a mother's day breakfast.

52
00:01:56,651 --> 00:01:57,657
只是正好今天是母亲节
This is breakfast that happens to be on --

53
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,520
你把我看作是是莉莉的妈妈
You think of me as Lily's mother!

54
00:01:59,980 --> 00:02:02,840
-当我是你的老婆 当我是女人 -你说什么
- I'm your wife! I'm a woman!! - What?

55
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:06,420
说实话 他这么责备我有点不爽
Honestly, I'm a little offended that he accused me of that.

56
00:02:06,447 --> 00:02:08,639
实际上 我对那个话题十分敏感
I'm acally very sensitive to that issue.

57
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:12,200
好像我有把我的伴侣当成过女人一样
Like I would ever treat my partner as a woman.

58
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:14,620
貌似有人换了新窗帘哦
Somebody got new curtains.

59
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:16,940
没办法 普里契特夫人喜欢购物
Well, Mrs. Pritchett loves to shop.

60
00:02:16,953 --> 00:02:19,567
看来6点之前是走不了了
Oh, we're never gonna be done by 6:00.

61
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:20,580
最好先打个电话回家
Better call home.

62
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,380
不然老婆会不高兴的
The wife's not gonna like this.

63
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:27,040
有时我觉得他就喜欢冲我发火
Sometimes I think he just wants to be mad at me.

64
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:29,720
-我吃不下 -好吧 随你便
- I can't eat! - Okay, you know what?

65
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,740
既然你不领我的情
If you can't accept the nice gesture,

66
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:32,980
那拉倒好了
Then just forget it.

67
00:02:33,076 --> 00:02:36,305
那气球放起来 她正在闹别扭呢
Okay, scratch the balloons. She is in a mood.

68
00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:52,520
我问克莱尔她母亲节想要什么
I asked claire what she wanted for mother's day,

69
00:02:52,620 --> 00:02:53,880
她说"滚得远远的"
And she said, "Take a hike."

70
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,460
当然不是对我说的
It's not like that.

71
00:02:56,513 --> 00:02:59,711
她只是痴迷于行走在大自然间
She's -- she's just bananas for walking around in nature.

72
00:02:59,754 --> 00:03:01,580
所以 她和歌洛莉亚
Um, so, she and -- and gloria

73
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:03,520
带孩子们去大峡谷
Are taking the kids up the canyon

74
00:03:03,559 --> 00:03:07,019
我和杰呢 就穿上围裙
Um,and jay and I are, uh, throwing on the aprons

75
00:03:07,071 --> 00:03:09,961
为她们准备一个母亲节盛宴
And preparing a mother day feast.

76
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,520
这嘛
It's...

77
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,620
肯定会非常有趣
It's gonna be fun.

78
00:03:16,738 --> 00:03:20,200
我知道你想要离我而去
I know you want to leave me

79
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:24,520
-可我不愿意 -厨房禁止杂耍
- But I refuse to -- - We're not doing that.

80
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:33,460
你应该知道这片树林里有狼出没吧
You know there are coyotes in these woods?

81
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,000
你带武器了吗
Did you pack a weapon?

82
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:36,180
我有跟拐杖
I have a walking stick.

83
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:37,820
它能当剑使吗
Does it become a sword?

84
00:03:37,850 --> 00:03:40,139
我感觉它能变成助跑拐杖吧
I guess it could become a running stick.

85
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:42,160
好吧 你的意思是你能跑过
All right, you're gonna outrun a coyote?

86
00:03:42,380 --> 00:03:44,380
世界上最快的哺乳动物土狼吗
The fastest mammal in the world?

87
00:03:44,476 --> 00:03:46,572
我不确定我是否有这能耐
I'm not sure that's true.

88
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:49,240
那你要怎么用冰棍棒击退它们呢
And how are you gonna fend them off with a popsicle stick?

89
00:03:49,740 --> 00:03:50,560
这是个矛
It's a spear.

90
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:52,480
还是一个酸橙味的矛
And it smells like lemon-lime,

91
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:54,160
土狼讨厌这个味道
A flavor coyotes hate.

92
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:56,400
你从哪儿知道这么多
Where are you getting your information?

93
00:03:56,660 --> 00:03:57,500
还有多远
How much farther?

94
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:59,020
我想走远点
Well, I'd like to go far enough

95
00:03:59,020 --> 00:04:00,800
远到看不见我们停车场里的车
that we can't still see our car in the parking lot.

96
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,580
我已经满嘴灰了
I'm getting dust in my mouth.

97
00:04:02,630 --> 00:04:05,875
-你要对大自然心怀感恩 -是的
- You have to appreciate nature. - Yes.

98
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:07,660
这里很快就变成购物中心了
Soon, this will be the mall.

99
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,480
-那时候我再来吧 -我饿了
- I'll come then. - I'm hungry.

100
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:14,080
那估计下肚的是我们的心情
Oh, then I guess we'll be eating the mood.

101
00:04:14,660 --> 00:04:15,900
我跟你完全无法交流
I don't get you at all.

102
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:16,900
我知道
I know.

103
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:20,920
那里是有派对吗
Oh, is that the party over there?

104
00:04:20,980 --> 00:04:22,120
我不知道 我是个女人 记得吗
I don't know. I'm a woman, remember?

105
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,360
我的方向感极差
I have a terrible sense of direction.

106
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:24,960
允许我重申一下 我最大的错误就是
May I remind you that my big crime

107
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:26,920
给你做了松软的煎饼 行了不
was making you fluffy pancakes, okay?

108
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:29,140
你揪着这事喋喋不休的烦死了
I'm getting a little sick of you dwelling on this.

109
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:32,040
今天是母亲节 不是折磨日
It happens to be Mother's Day, not Martyr's Day.

110
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:33,240
米奇尔
Mitchell.

111
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:36,760
我错了 这对我来说是个敏感的事情
I'm sorry. It's just a sensitive issue for me.

112
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:37,260
行了
Okay.

113
00:04:37,260 --> 00:04:39,780
同志最讨厌的事情莫过于
There's nothing gays hate more than when people...

114
00:04:39,822 --> 00:04:41,086
-人们把我们当作女人 -人们把我们当作女人
- treat us like women. - Treat us like women.

115
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,060
我们是纯爷儿们
We're not.

116
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:44,220
我们不想去你们的婴儿洗礼
We don't want to go to your baby shower.

117
00:04:44,460 --> 00:04:46,320
我们不会来"大姨妈"
We don't have a time of the month.

118
00:04:46,460 --> 00:04:47,580
我们也不是粉色控
We don't love pink.

119
00:04:47,580 --> 00:04:48,525
但是你喜爱粉色
Well, you love pink.

120
00:04:48,525 --> 00:04:51,300
-不 是粉色喜欢我 -好吧
- No, pink loves me. - Okay.

121
00:04:51,300 --> 00:04:54,100
-伙计们好啊 -你好 那是...
- Hey, guys! - Hey! So...

122
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,860
那是珍 老公叫瑞克 小孩叫迪亚哥
That's Jen, husband Rick, baby Diego.

123
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,640
我也不熟
I don't get it either.

124
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:58,880
珍 我来帮你
Hey, Jen. Let me help you with that.

125
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,420
瑞克 你好啊
Rick! How you doing?

126
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:05,060
我们周末应该多搞点团队活动
We should do play group on weekends more often.

127
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:07,240
有老公在身边帮忙就是好 对吧
It's nice to have the husbands around to help, right?

128
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:09,880
是啊 因为这让全世界都觉得
Oh, yeah, because that makes all the sense in the world --

129
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:10,620
你才是丈夫
You as the husband.

130
00:05:10,820 --> 00:05:11,840
行了 她不是那意思
Stop it. That's not what she meant.

131
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:13,360
瞧瞧我们 我都可以把你那小身板给折断
Look at us. I could snap you like a twig.

132
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,440
够了 每隔段时间你就拿我的小身板出来说
Okay, every once in a while you say that thing about the twig,

133
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,020
-你要知道这让我很反感 -对不起
- And I need you to know that it bothers me. - Sorry.

134
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,160
好了 各位 母亲节快乐
Okay, everybody. Happy Mother's Day!

135
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:21,960
我代表所有的男士们
I know I speak for all the guys

136
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:24,280
感谢你们在我们下班风流快活的时候
when I say thank you for everything you do

137
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,340
所默默付出的一切
while we're off having affairs.

138
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:28,180
开玩笑的 我待会儿回家跪搓衣板
I'm kidding. I'll pay for that later.

139
00:05:28,820 --> 00:05:30,740
我们先为妈妈和宝贝们拍张合影
Uh, let's get the moms and kids together for a picture!

140
00:05:30,784 --> 00:05:31,840
完了 走 快走
No, let's go. Let's get out of here.

141
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:32,620
手推车不要了 赶紧跑
Leave the stroller and run.

142
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:34,572
小卡 停下 没人会叫你去
Cam, stop. No one's going to ask you to --

143
00:05:34,620 --> 00:05:34,880
卡梅隆 快过来
Cameron, get on up here.

144
00:05:35,860 --> 00:05:37,860
不用了吧 你们先拍吧
I don't know. You guys just go ahead.

145
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:40,340
-你可是名誉妈妈 -也不是啦
- You're an honorary mom! - Oh, I don't know.

146
00:05:40,355 --> 00:05:42,760
好吧好吧
Uh, okay, all right.

147
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:43,800
-放手 -快过去吧
- Unhand me. - Get over there.

148
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,180
这不太合适吧
That's -- that's...

149
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,640
站近点 近点
Okay, tighten up, tighten up.

150
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,780
看这里 女士们
Up here, ladies!

151
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:53,260
太美了 再来一张 美女们
Beautiful. One more, gals.

152
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:56,440
谢谢女士们 非常感谢 太美了
Oh, thanks, ladies. Thanks so much. Perfect.

153
00:05:56,470 --> 00:05:58,420
真棒 好了
Great. Okay.

154
00:06:00,260 --> 00:06:02,560
是的 那肯定是毒葛
Yeah, that was definitely poison oak.

155
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:04,280
我觉得这皮疹在扩大
I think this rash is spreading.

156
00:06:04,301 --> 00:06:05,820
曼尼 那不是皮疹
Manny, that's not a rash.

157
00:06:05,851 --> 00:06:07,338
它变红是因为你抓的
It's red because you scratch it.

158
00:06:07,380 --> 00:06:09,000
我只是想没话找话说
I just don't want my throat to close.

159
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:10,580
闭嘴不见得是件坏事
Wouldn't be the worst thing.

160
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:12,700
我太无聊了 我宁愿看书
I'm so bored, I'd rather be reading.

161
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,240
我也是 为了不无聊到麻木
I'm so bored, I chewed the last bug

162
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,860
我把刚飞进我嘴里的飞虫拿来磨牙
that flew in my mouth just to feel something.

163
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,700
我都无聊到跟你说话了
I'm so bored, I'm talking to you.

164
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,040
够了
Ugh! Okay!

165
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,420
在刚才的二十分钟里
For the last 20 minutes,

166
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:22,540
你们这些人只知道抱怨
all you people have done is whine!

167
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,560
你们有没有想过今天是母亲节
You would think on mother's day, at least,

168
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,220
至少 要说也说点好听的
You would have something nice to say --

169
00:06:26,262 --> 00:06:27,833
-别说话 -怎么了
-Shh! - What?

170
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:31,400
我以为听到了土狼的声音 继续说吧
Thought I heard a coyote. Go ahead.

171
00:06:32,380 --> 00:06:33,860
天啊 卢克 你个傻帽
God, Luke, you're such an idiot.

172
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:35,680
至少我看起来不像个傻帽
At least I don't look like an idiot.

173
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,220
-什么意思 -你的帽子
- What does that mean? - Your hat.

174
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,980
看起来像你头上飞的鸟 拉了一坨丑帽子
It's like you walked under a bird that poops ugly hats.

175
00:06:41,020 --> 00:06:42,060
能不能注意语言文明
Can we watch the language?

176
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,420
我们也没有其它东西可以注意了
There's nothing else to watch.

177
00:06:43,740 --> 00:06:44,780
闹够了没有
Enough complaining!

178
00:06:44,838 --> 00:06:46,293
不要因为这一天没在沙滩度过
You can't bitch all day

179
00:06:46,340 --> 00:06:48,080
就整天发牢骚
because you're not at the beach all day.

180
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:49,720
跟上
Come on.

181
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,840
不不不
No. No, no.

182
00:06:51,877 --> 00:06:54,300
我要送我自己一个母亲节礼物
I-I'm giving myself a mother's day present.

183
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:56,200
孩子们 你们的徒步旅行结束了
Kids, your hike is over.

184
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,440
-好 -耶
- Yes! - Yeah!

185
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:59,260
不 不要得意
No! No, not happy.

186
00:06:59,260 --> 00:07:00,808
-不好 很不好 -对
- Bad. Sad. - Mm.

187
00:07:00,845 --> 00:07:02,283
我和歌洛莉亚要去完成
Gloria and I are gonna go finish

188
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:04,360
这次绝美的徒步旅行 你们就呆在这
this beautiful hike together while you sit here

189
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:07,540
好好思考你们是如何自私和无脑
and think about how selfish and thoughtless you've been.

190
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:09,160
我们走
Come on.

191
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:11,620
如果我们无脑 我们怎么能思考
If we're thoughtless, how can we think?

192
00:07:15,277 --> 00:07:17,489
老娘没收你的水
You just lost your water.

193
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:18,380
我们走
Let's go.

194
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:31,200
你戴的什么玩意儿
What the hell are those?

195
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:33,700
洋葱护目镜 这样做饭就不流泪了
Onion goggles. No more tears when I cook.

196
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:36,700
欢迎来到21世纪 你应该去搞一副
Welcome to the 21st century. You should get a pair.

197
00:07:36,754 --> 00:07:38,786
我也打算这么做
I was gonna suggest the same thing.

198
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,460
杰 你知道我们应该放些什么进去吗
Hey, Jay, you know what we should put in this?

199
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:42,340
-我们应该放 -不行
- We should add a da-- - No.

200
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:43,780
这是我妈妈的食谱
It's my mom's recipe.

201
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,480
上面说放什么就放什么
What it says on the page goes in the pot.

202
00:07:46,540 --> 00:07:47,680
一样不能多 一样不能少
Nothing more, nothing less.

203
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,880
牛肉和香肠我要搅拌多久
Now, how long do I stir the beef and sausages?

204
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:50,920
读给我听
Read it to me.

205
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:54,260
牛肉和香肠搅拌5分钟
You should stir the beef and sausages for five minutes.

206
00:07:54,420 --> 00:07:55,840
我要忍受你模仿
And how much longer do I have to listen

207
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:57,337
《朱莉娅·柴尔德印象厨房》到什么时候
to the Julia Child Impression?

208
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,000
一直到这个没意思了为止
For as long as it's still funny.

209
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,900
我觉得已经够了
I think the timer just went off on that.

210
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,140
不必这样吧
That was unnecessary.

211
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,380
这是什么
What's this?

212
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:07,260
什么
What?!

213
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,480
杰 在做好这个以后
Hey, Jay, maybe after this,

214
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,740
我们应该再做一道"完美妈妈"
we should make "the perfect mom."

215
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:15,560
我们只需要"一汤勺爱 一杯温暖
All we need is "a tablespoon of love, 1 cup of warmth,

216
00:08:15,940 --> 00:08:17,820
以及一颗慈爱的心"
add one heart, softened."

217
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:19,240
你到底在说啥
What the hell are you talking about?

218
00:08:19,260 --> 00:08:21,340
这个完美妈妈食谱
This recipe for the perfect mom,

219
00:08:21,372 --> 00:08:24,076
杰·弗朗西斯·普里契特写于9岁
by Jay Francis Fritchett, age nine.

220
00:08:25,392 --> 00:08:27,718
这个我都忘了
Geez, I forgot all about that.

221
00:08:28,644 --> 00:08:30,780
我都不知道她把这个放食谱里面了
I didn't know she had that in there.

222
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:31,640
怎么了 弗朗西斯
What's that, Francis?

223
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:32,720
没什么
Nothing.

224
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,600
肉还要搅拌多久
How much longer on the meat?

225
00:08:35,823 --> 00:08:38,828
我喜欢"做给一个小男孩吃"这句
I love the part about "serves one small boy."

226
00:08:38,860 --> 00:08:39,820
太可爱了
That's adorable.

227
00:08:43,020 --> 00:08:45,160
"175磅的温柔"
"175 pounds of tenderness."

228
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,640
她肯定爱死这个了 她很胖吗
She must have loved that. Big woman?

229
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:51,660
杰
Jay?

230
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,200
于是我就看见了
And that's when I saw it.

231
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:54,880
杰
Jay...

232
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:58,160
你是不是
Are...

233
00:08:58,191 --> 00:08:59,738
-在哭 -没有
- Are you crying? - No!

234
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:02,430
都是洋葱惹的祸 靠 护目镜给我
It's the onions, damn it. Give me these.

235
00:09:03,647 --> 00:09:06,009
你看什么看
What are you lookin' at?

236
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:06,520
没什么
Nothing.

237
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,960
这护目镜和你脸型很相称
Those really frame your face.

238
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:19,500
漂亮
Beautiful.

239
00:09:19,568 --> 00:09:23,995
谢谢
Ay, thank you.

240
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,820
我不想让你批评我
Okay, I don't want you to judge me,

241
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:27,060
但是有些东西我不吐不快
but I have to say something.

242
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:29,600
有时候我真想揍我的孩子们
Sometimes, I want to punch my kids.

243
00:09:30,060 --> 00:09:32,180
-你不会真心想这么做 -不 我真的想
- You don't mean that. - No, I do. I do.

244
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,320
上次就跟今天一样 他们非常讨厌
The last time they were horrible the way they were today,

245
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,920
他们正好站成了一排
They happened to be all lined up.

246
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:37,580
我那时禁不住想
And I couldn't help but think,

247
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:39,240
如果我打倒他们其中一个
"If I hit just one of them,

248
00:09:39,265 --> 00:09:41,909
其余两个就会像多米诺骨牌一样倒下来
the rest would go down like dominos."

249
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,480
我知道
I know.

250
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:43,940
这样我就会失去
That would rob me of the pleasure

251
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:46,040
把他们一个一个打到的乐趣 但是
of hitting each one individually, but...

252
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:48,820
天啊 你可不能这么说自己的孩子
Oh, my god, you don't talk about your children this way.

253
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:51,080
行了吧 你知道曼尼有时候惹你生气
Oh, come on. You know Manny irritates you.

254
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:54,020
不 曼尼是我生命中最美好的存在
No. Manny is the best thing that ever happened to me.

255
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,320
我们之间有种特殊的纽带
We have a special bond.

256
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:56,860
对 纽带 我懂
Yes, bonds. I know.

257
00:09:56,860 --> 00:09:58,500
但这不是现在我要说的
but that's not what I'm talking about now.

258
00:09:58,820 --> 00:10:00,240
克莱尔 很长一段时间
Claire, for a long time,

259
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,700
都是我们母子俩相依为命
it was only the two of us.

260
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,060
我不能说任何关于这个孩子的坏话
I cannot say anything bad about that boy.

261
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,860
得了吧 歌洛莉亚
Give me a break, Gloria!

262
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:08,680
有孩子的人都知道
Anybody who's ever had a kid knows

263
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:10,540
在某些事情上他们会
that they can irritate the freaking life

264
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:11,600
让你的生活变得抓狂
out of you at some point.

265
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,300
我说的对吗
Am I right?

266
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:15,340
算了
Oh. Okay.

267
00:10:17,923 --> 00:10:20,506
他很小气
He's persnickety.

268
00:10:20,580 --> 00:10:21,800
-什么 -曼尼
- What? - Manny.

269
00:10:21,833 --> 00:10:24,698
他太小气了 这让我抓狂
He's persnickety. It drives me up the wall.

270
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,240
很好 小气 良好的开始
Okay, persnickety. Good start.

271
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:28,589
他总是粘着我
He follows me around all the time.

272
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:29,400
有时候我会很享受
Sometimes I love it,

273
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:31,100
但有时侯我需要有自己的空间
but sometimes I need my own space.

274
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:34,140
说出这些事情并不意味着你是一个坏母亲
This does not make you a bad mother to admit these things.

275
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:36,580
还有那些诗 真的是太差劲了
And the poetry. It's not very good.

276
00:10:36,630 --> 00:10:38,817
我终于第一次大声的说出来了
Ah. First time that I say that out loud.

277
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:39,220
不错
Okay.

278
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,600
真的是太差劲了
It's not very good!

279
00:10:43,514 --> 00:10:46,503
我爱曼尼 但是 你知道的 有时我
I-I love Manny, but, you know, sometimes I --

280
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:48,020
要像个男孩子
Just be a boy!

281
00:10:48,020 --> 00:10:51,040
去外面闯闯 踢踢球 偷偷东西什么的
Go outside. Kick a ball. Steal something.

282
00:10:53,180 --> 00:10:54,640
感觉好极了
It feels so good!

283
00:10:55,660 --> 00:10:57,020
或许你是感觉好极了
Maybe to you.

284
00:10:58,542 --> 00:11:00,790
不 曼尼
No, Manny! Ay!

285
00:11:00,820 --> 00:11:06,500
我说的是我以前认识的曼尼
I was talking about another Manny that I know long time ago!

286
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:07,560
恶魔[西班牙语]
Diablo!

287
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:09,040
曼尼
Manny!

288
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,920
你知道吗 远足死的人可比整个
You know, more people have died hiking

289
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,420
内战死的人多多了
than in the entire civil war?

290
00:11:14,481 --> 00:11:16,879
好的 你是在哪本书上看到的
Ok, what book did you read that in?

291
00:11:16,940 --> 00:11:17,180
书
Book?

292
00:11:17,232 --> 00:11:19,294
醒醒吧 奶奶 现在是互联网时代
Wake up and smell the internet, grandma.

293
00:11:19,325 --> 00:11:22,538
妈妈想要我们跟她道歉
You know mom's just gonn want us to apologize.

294
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:24,700
我们的确是毁了她的母亲节
Well, we did kind of ruin her mother's day.

295
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,960
不 是她自己毁掉的
No, she ruined her mother's day.

296
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:28,240
她把我们带到一个
She took us to a place

297
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,400
她明知我们不会喜欢的地方
she knew we wouldn't like.

298
00:11:29,443 --> 00:11:31,180
我们就抱怨了那么几秒钟
And then we complain for like a second,

299
00:11:31,180 --> 00:11:32,140
就成了坏人了吗
and we're the bad guys?

300
00:11:32,380 --> 00:11:33,400
说得对
That's a good point.

301
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:35,540
你有没有感觉她是故意这么做的
You ever get the feeling she does this intentionally?

302
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,220
她为什么要这么做
Why would she do that?

303
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:39,520
-这样她就可以让我们感到愧疚 -没错
- So she can make us feel guilty. - Exactly.

304
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:41,200
下次我们决定要做什么的时候
And the next time we're choosing what to do,

305
00:11:41,260 --> 00:11:42,220
她就又可以得逞了
she gets her way again.

306
00:11:42,340 --> 00:11:43,840
以及下次 下下次
And the next time and the next time.

307
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,720
最终 每天都是母亲节
And eventually, it's mother's day every day.

308
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,860
妈妈真的是很聪明
Wow. Mom's really smart.

309
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,240
她可不及我
Well, not smarter than me.

310
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:50,020
这个嘛
Well...

311
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:52,620
我建议我们这次不跟她道歉
I say we don't apologize this time,

312
00:11:52,715 --> 00:11:54,905
让她知道 我们跟她的小把戏耗上了
Let her know we're onto her little game.

313
00:11:54,936 --> 00:11:56,967
我们可以改变整个家庭的运行模式
We could change the way this whole family operates.

314
00:11:57,020 --> 00:11:58,660
好的 没有人会跟她道歉
Okay, so nobody says they're sorry.

315
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:01,140
明白了没 等她回来时嘴巴都闭紧了
Got it? Keep your mouths shut when she comes back.

316
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,380
如果她回得来的话
If she comes back.

317
00:12:04,860 --> 00:12:06,640
杰在我面前泪眼婆娑
Jay teared up in front of me.

318
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,460
我从不知道他还有这么脆弱的一面
He'd never shown me that kind of vulnerability,

319
00:12:09,501 --> 00:12:12,149
这让他很尴尬
and it embarrassed him.

320
00:12:12,180 --> 00:12:13,700
我让那头骄傲的狮子感到惭愧
I'd shamed the proud lion.

321
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,700
唯一能做的
Only thing to do...

322
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:19,300
拥抱那头骄傲的狮子
...hug the proud lion.

323
00:12:24,340 --> 00:12:25,540
我可能会被咬
Oh, I could get bit.

324
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:28,260
我或许会被抓伤
I could get scratched.

325
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,960
但你知道每头狮子心里都装着什么吗
But you know what's inside every lion?

326
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,460
一只小猫咪
A pussycat.

327
00:12:32,620 --> 00:12:33,980
你给我滚远点
I need you to get away from me.

328
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:35,406
好的
Yep.

329
00:12:38,123 --> 00:12:40,300
好的 我只说一次
Okay, I'm just gonna say this one time

330
00:12:40,300 --> 00:12:41,280
然后就不提这茬了
so we can move on.

331
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,580
-这没什么 -明白
- It's okay. - Gotcha.

332
00:12:43,638 --> 00:12:47,656
你知道"这"代表的是什么吗
You -- you know what "It" is?

333
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:48,540
是你的哭泣
It's you crying.

334
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,360
-我没哭 -你流泪了
- Which I didn't. - You teared up.

335
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,520
都说是洋葱惹的祸
It was the onions.

336
00:12:52,620 --> 00:12:54,100
好的 好的
Okay, okay.

337
00:12:54,133 --> 00:12:57,187
或许是我自动代入了你的角色多想了
Maybe I'm -- maybe I'm just putting myself in your place,

338
00:12:57,220 --> 00:12:59,320
但是如果我碰巧发现儿时的东西
but if I came across something from my childhood,

339
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:03,120
而它又让我想起我母亲 我或许会泪水迷蒙
and it reminded me of my mom, I might get a little misty,

340
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,560
甚至还会想要找人倾诉
maybe even want to talk about it.

341
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:06,040
这里
Here.

342
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:21,700
太骄傲了
So proud.

343
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:24,960
他们给了我一束花 米奇尔
They offered me a bouquet, Mitchell.

344
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,160
你接受了
Which you accepted.

345
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:28,800
为什么你就不能站在我这边
Why can't you ever take my side?

346
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:30,960
他们把我当女人
They think of me as a woman!

347
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:31,940
小卡 不 拜托
Cam, no, come on.

348
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,960
我们是新型的家庭 你知道的
We're just a new type of family, you know?

349
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:36,180
他们还不知道怎么正确对待我们
They don't have the right vocabulary for us yet.

350
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:38,460
他们把其中的一个当做家庭中的母亲
They need one of us to be the mom.

351
00:13:38,700 --> 00:13:40,000
为什么把我认作女人呢
So why does it have to be me?

352
00:13:40,020 --> 00:13:41,020
我又没穿裙子
Do I wear a dress?

353
00:13:41,098 --> 00:13:42,615
那是睡袍
That's a nightshirt!

354
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:44,080
又光滑又柔软
It's kind of satiny.

355
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:45,480
你是什么意思
What are you saying?

356
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:47,480
拜托 你知道的
Come on, you know.

357
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:49,380
不 我不知道
No. No, no, no. I don't know.

358
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:52,540
好吧 我想
All right, if I'm thinking about it,

359
00:13:52,740 --> 00:13:55,400
如果咱俩个中 一定要选一个的话
of the two of us, if I had to pick,

360
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:58,660
我觉得在母亲这个角色上 你稍微地赢过我
I might say that you're slightly...Mom-er.

361
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:02,840
不好意思 你可以把那个球扔一下吗
Excuse me. Can you throw that ball?

362
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:04,360
我可以投球吗
Can I throw a ball?

363
00:14:04,407 --> 00:14:07,802
-你认为我不能投球吗 -小卡
- You don't think I can throw a ball? - Cam

364
00:14:07,860 --> 00:14:12,640
-住嘴 你别插话 -他不是那个意思
- No, no, no. - That's not what he said.

365
00:14:12,650 --> 00:14:12,954
不 很显然 这位先生
No, apparently, this gentleman

366
00:14:12,966 --> 00:14:13,555
认为我投不了球
doesn't think I can throw a ball.

367
00:14:13,562 --> 00:14:13,915
他不是这个意思
Oh, that's not what he said.

368
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:16,160
你认为我投不了球 等着瞧
You think I can't throw a ball? Well, let's find out!

369
00:14:19,156 --> 00:14:20,673
天啊 他年纪看起来挺大的
Oo god. He looks old.

370
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,680
对不起
Oh, sorry!

371
00:14:21,980 --> 00:14:22,920
小卡 你的兰花指
Cam, hands.

372
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:23,540
对不起
Sorry!

373
00:14:24,860 --> 00:14:25,700
看吧
There you go.

374
00:14:26,412 --> 00:14:29,140
曼尼 我不是那个意思
Manny, I didn't mean any of it.

375
00:14:29,140 --> 00:14:30,620
原谅我吧
Please forgive me!

376
00:14:30,820 --> 00:14:33,080
我觉得我做不到吧 咱们快上车走吧
I don't think I can. Let's just get in the van.

377
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,060
对不起 我说话押韵了
Oh. Sorry for the rhyme.

378
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,560
我知道你有多讨厌我的诗
I know how you "hate my poetry."

379
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:38,320
不要再折磨我了
Please, stop my suffering!

380
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:40,500
你也对我说些很糟糕的话吧
Say something terrible about me

381
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:42,520
那我们就可以扯平了
so that we can be even like steven.

382
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:45,000
为什么我要对我爱的人说可怕的话呢
Why would I say something terrible to someone I love?

383
00:14:45,340 --> 00:14:47,400
我诅咒自己的舌头
I curse my tongue!

384
00:14:47,443 --> 00:14:49,397
我插一句
I'm gonna intervene here.

385
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:51,860
曼尼 我来说一下真实的情况
Manny, let's talk about what really happened, okay?

386
00:14:51,860 --> 00:14:53,900
你妈妈的意思是你应该多出去玩玩球
Your mom said you should go out and throw a ball around.

387
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,700
那不可能是你第一次听到这种话吧
That can't be the first time you've heard that.

388
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:58,640
是的 但这些关于我的诗的话太伤人了
No. But there was some hurtful stuff said about my poetry.

389
00:14:59,020 --> 00:15:00,780
你妈妈很后悔说了这些话
Which your mom regrets.

390
00:15:00,900 --> 00:15:01,620
是的
I do!

391
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:04,240
所以 这就是家长要做的事
So? That's what parents are for.

392
00:15:04,460 --> 00:15:07,660
有时候他们批评你 可以让你变得更强大
Sometimes they criticize because it helps make you stronger.

393
00:15:07,660 --> 00:15:11,060
现在的孩子一直被夸奖
Kids these days get trophies just for showing up.

394
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:12,593
会导致什么结果呢
What's that gonna lead to?

395
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:14,720
三十多岁了还住在家里
A bunch of 30-year-olds living at home.

396
00:15:14,936 --> 00:15:17,210
曼尼 你妈妈非常爱你
Manny, your mom loves you very much.

397
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,540
但是她也是个普通人
But she's a human being.

398
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,380
所以她也会想要小小地发泄一下
So she let off a little steam.

399
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:23,380
事实上 或许这对你们来说是好事
Honestly, it's probably a great thing for your relationship.

400
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:25,700
-我觉得我可以 -不要说了
- I guess I can - Stop.

401
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,360
我要让他知道真相
He needs to know the real truth.

402
00:15:29,260 --> 00:15:31,420
曼尼 克莱尔觉得很糟糕
Manny, Claire was feeling bad

403
00:15:31,420 --> 00:15:33,860
因为她想要打自己的孩子
because she wants to hit her own children,

404
00:15:34,180 --> 00:15:35,860
所以我为了让她舒服些
So I tried to make her feel better

405
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:38,560
就胡说了一些关于你的坏话
by inventing terrible things about you.

406
00:15:39,140 --> 00:15:41,580
你是说 你对我的诗没有意见
You mean you don't have a problem with my poetry?

407
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:44,140
没有 唯一的问题是
No, the only problem that I have

408
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:46,420
我怎么都听不够
is that I never have enough of it.

409
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:50,140
在任何什么方面 你都是个完美的孩子
You're the perfect kid in every way.

410
00:15:50,891 --> 00:15:52,316
我的爱
Ay, mi amor

411
00:15:52,333 --> 00:15:53,896
这亲情真健康
Wow. That's healthy.

412
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:55,820
好了 你回来了
Good. You're back.

413
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:56,900
咱们没事了吧
Are we done?

414
00:15:56,949 --> 00:15:58,896
除非在这个特殊的节日里
Unless the you have something to say

415
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:00,960
你们有话要对带给你们生命的人说
to the person who gave you life on her special day.

416
00:16:00,996 --> 00:16:04,924
-没有 -没有
- Nope. - I'm good.

417
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:06,460
我的宝贝卢克呢
My baby, Luke?

418
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:10,300
没有
No.

419
00:16:15,860 --> 00:16:17,260
给你 这是什么
Here. What's this?

420
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:19,120
母亲节贺卡
Well, it's a mother's day card.

421
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,520
我知道了 别这样 好吧
And I know -- stop it! Okay.

422
00:16:20,820 --> 00:16:23,400
小卡 这是曼尼给歌洛莉亚的贺卡
Cam, that was Gloria's card from Manny

423
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:24,580
我只是想让你知道
But I just wanted you to see

424
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:26,600
里面对母亲的定义
what its definition for "Mother" was on it.

425
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:29,460
是温暖 养育和支持
It's warm, nurturing, supportive.

426
00:16:29,660 --> 00:16:31,620
或许别人认为你是家庭中母亲
You know, maybe when the world sees you as a mom --

427
00:16:31,620 --> 00:16:32,440
不只是别人
Not just the world.

428
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,500
好吧 我也一样
Fine. Fine. Me too.

429
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:36,740
或许这正是我们所见的
But maybe this is what we're seeing,

430
00:16:36,740 --> 00:16:38,820
我不觉得这是件坏事
And I don't know why that's such a bad thing.

431
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:42,000
它丝毫没减少你的男子气概 对吗
It certainly doesn't make you less of a man, right?

432
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:45,040
-也许你是对的 -没错
- Maybe you're right. - Yeah.

433
00:16:45,740 --> 00:16:46,940
来吧 快加入他们的派对
Come on, let's join the party.

434
00:16:46,978 --> 00:16:48,320
还有 小卡 把酒放下
And, Cam, put down the scotch.

435
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,140
你骗不了任何人
You're not fooling anyone.

436
00:16:49,182 --> 00:16:51,764
这酒辣死了 天啊
It is so burn-y. Oh, my god.

437
00:16:51,820 --> 00:16:54,220
快过来 大家都到桌子这儿来
Come on, people! Everybody to the table!

438
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:01,080
我只是很难接受这件事
It's just hard, you know?

439
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:03,720
好好的母亲节被毁了
Having your mother's day ruined.

440
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:08,900
我没有想到毁了它的人会是你 卢卡斯
I never thought it would be you, Lucas.

441
00:17:15,420 --> 00:17:16,860
连想都别想
Don't even think about it.

442
00:17:16,860 --> 00:17:18,051
但是她很伤心
But she's sad.

443
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:19,220
她伤心是因为她快输了
Sad she's losing.

444
00:17:19,420 --> 00:17:21,100
她刚只是使出最拿手的煽情招数 试图打动你
She just hit you with her best shot.

445
00:17:21,180 --> 00:17:22,180
咱们得保持强硬的态度
We need to stay strong.

446
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,780
-但是我感觉 -不许感觉
- But I feel-- - Don't feel!

447
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:26,240
去洗把脸 拿出你的男子气慨
Just go splash water on your face and man up!

448
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:33,080
现在我们就是你的妈妈
We're your mother now.

449
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:37,400
你今天跟我爸过得怎么样
How was your day with my dad?

450
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:39,960
说实话 很尴尬
Awkward, actually.

451
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:42,180
他 他小哭了一把
He, um... He cried a little.

452
00:17:42,215 --> 00:17:43,385
-我爸 -嘘
- My dad?! - Shh!

453
00:17:43,420 --> 00:17:45,040
-爸怎么了 -他哭了
- Dad what? - He cried.

454
00:17:45,100 --> 00:17:46,340
没有 我没说他哭了
No, I didn't say he cried.

455
00:17:46,420 --> 00:17:47,700
-谁哭了 -我爸 -别说了
- Who cried? - My dad. - Stop!

456
00:17:47,940 --> 00:17:49,560
你为什么要让杰哭泣
Why would you make Jay sob like that?

457
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:51,040
我没让他哭泣
I didn't make him sob.

458
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:53,420
他哭是因为我发现
He teared up when I found this poem

459
00:17:53,420 --> 00:17:55,600
他小时候写给妈妈的诗
he wrote for his mom as a boy.

460
00:17:57,047 --> 00:18:00,248
-你们在感叹什么 -菲尔看见爸哭了
- What is "Ohh"? - Phil saw dad cry.

461
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:01,660
杰想妈妈了
Jay misses his mama.

462
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:03,920
-你们都给我住嘴 -有人饿了吗
- Everybody, stop! - Is anybody hungry?

463
00:18:06,780 --> 00:18:09,260
-怎么了 -你为了你妈妈哭了
- What? - You cried for your mommy?

464
00:18:09,700 --> 00:18:11,120
妈的 我才没哭
Oh, crap. I did not.

465
00:18:11,135 --> 00:18:12,280
你哭了 菲尔刚才告诉我们的
Yes, Phil just told us--

466
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,960
没有 那不是真的 她说谎
No, that's not true. She's a liar.

467
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:14,940
你这算怎么回事
What's wrong with you?

468
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:17,820
我知道如果我因为我妈
Look, I know you would all be so happy

469
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:20,220
而情绪失控 你们会很高兴
if you thought I had some big emotional moment

470
00:18:20,220 --> 00:18:22,100
但是我没有
about my mom, but I didn't.

471
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:23,580
所以说你并不想念你妈妈咯
So you don't miss your mom?

472
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:25,460
我当然想她 她是个杰出的女性
Of course I do. She was a great lady.

473
00:18:25,460 --> 00:18:29,280
而且她也给我留下一份完美无比的酱料配方
And she also left me a fantastic recipe for sauce,

474
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:30,660
现在酱都要冷掉了
which now is getting cold.

475
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:32,000
所以我们能用餐了吗
So can we please eat?

476
00:18:32,065 --> 00:18:35,452
-赞成 -去拿点酒来
- Hear, hear! - Just grab some wine.

477
00:18:35,500 --> 00:18:37,320
我的上帝 闻闻看
Oh, my Gosh, smell that.

478
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:39,040
这味道就跟以前在奶奶家闻的一样
It smells like grandma's house.

479
00:18:39,140 --> 00:18:40,260
你们还记得那个味道啊
Hey, you guys remember that?

480
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:42,280
我记得我第一次切意大利面
I remember the first time I cut spaghetti.

481
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:44,600
-不行 -奶奶就那样跟我说不行
- Eh-eh! - That's what she did! Eh-eh!

482
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:46,280
没错 不 你不能切意大利面
Yeah, no, you can't cut spaghetti.

483
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:47,460
她教会我要转着吃
She taught me to twirl.

484
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:48,720
所以是她把你转弯的吧
Oh, so she's the one.

485
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:50,300
没错 她很严格
Yeah, she was tough.

486
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:52,060
我记得有个联赛的小教练
I remember I had this little league coach.

487
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:53,200
有一次在一场比赛结束之后
And one time after a game,

488
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:55,340
他因为某事而痛斥我
he was laying into me about something.

489
00:18:55,340 --> 00:18:55,880
具体是什么我忘了
I don't remember.

490
00:18:55,933 --> 00:18:57,780
但我妈从看台那冲出来
But mom comes charging out of the stands.

491
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:58,780
她径直走到教练那
She goes right up to the guy --

492
00:18:58,780 --> 00:19:00,680
我是说 面对面 你眼望我眼那种
I mean, face to face, nose to nose --

493
00:19:00,820 --> 00:19:02,320
然后她对他说 "我告诉你
And she says to him, "Let me tell you something --

494
00:19:02,560 --> 00:19:04,820
"没有人 真的没有人
"Nobody, and I mean nobody,

495
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:06,420
"能这么吼我的
"Yells at my little

496
00:19:06,420 --> 00:19:09,020
儿子"
Boy."

497
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:11,760
我的天 他又哭了
Oh, my god! It's happening again!

498
00:19:11,816 --> 00:19:13,551
没关系 杰 男人哭吧不是罪
It's okay, Jay. Let it out.

499
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:15,120
-尽情宣泄吧 -人只有一个妈妈
- Let it out. - You only get one mom.

500
00:19:16,660 --> 00:19:18,140
我很抱歉 妈
I'm sorry, mom!

501
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:19,800
我也是
Me too!

502
00:19:19,845 --> 00:19:23,594
一瓶红酒 一瓶 什么状况
A bottle of red, a bottle of -- what?!

503
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:29,077
真好 到底是谁不够强硬
Oh, yeah, and I'm the weak one.

504
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:31,580
米奇尔
Mitchell?

505
00:19:31,601 --> 00:19:33,343
我就不用了
Oh, I'm good.

506
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:52,360
菲尔
Phil!

507
00:19:52,413 --> 00:19:54,185
-爸 -过来 宝贝儿
- Dad! - Come on, honey!

508
00:19:54,220 --> 00:19:55,460
对不起
I'm sorry.

509
00:19:55,489 --> 00:19:57,783
-讨厌 从我身上下去 -对不起嘛
- Ew, get off of me! - I'm sorry!

510
00:20:01,482 --> 00:20:02,653
爸爸
Dada!

511
00:20:02,653 --> 00:20:04,771
我觉得她是在叫你
Oh, I think she's calling you.

512
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:05,340
想都别想
Don't even try.

513
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:07,460
明天早晨我还有陶瓷课
I have that pottery class in the morning.

514
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:11,680
杰 咱们去睡觉吧
Jay, let's go to bed.

515
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:12,680
马上就来
Be right up.

516
00:20:21,620 --> 00:20:22,880
真他妈失策
Son of a bitch.
